<title>CHINA: TABLE-SHANGHAI DAJIANG 97 H1 NET DOWN.</title>
<headline>TABLE-SHANGHAI DAJIANG 97 H1 NET DOWN.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 31, 1997</p>
<p>(in millions of yuan unless stated, against 1996 figures)</p>
<p> Turnover		  1,263.871	vs  1,179.116</p>
<p> Net profit		   45.429	vs     58.581</p>
<p> Net asset per share	 1.99  yuan vs	2.11 yuan</p>
<p> Earnings per share	  0.081 yuan vs	0.114 yuan</p>
<p>Company name: Shanghai Dajiang (Group) Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Note: The results were contained in a company statement released on Monday.</p>
<p>The figures are unaudited as Chinese securities rules do not require listed firms to have their interim results audited.</p>
<p>-- Shanghai Newsroom (8621) 6279-7004 Fax: 6279-7174</p>
